'''''Hero, Ignite That Primal Sun''''' is a [[Trailblaze Mission]] in the chapter [[For the Sun is Set to Die]].

==Steps==
# Witness the truth of Amphoreus
# Bid farewell to The Homeland Within
# Talk to Hysilens
# Follow Hysilens to greet Imperator Cerydra
# Greet Imperator Cerydra
# Witness the end of the 1st Eternal Recurrence
# Talk to Anaxa
# Follow Anaxa to obtain the Coreflame of Reason
# Confront Cipher
# "You will bear the blazing sun, until the pale dawn breaks."
# "You will bear the blazing sun, until... dawn breaks..."
# Bid farewell to The Hero Within
# "You will bear the blazing sun, until..."
# Witness the end of Khaslana
# "You will bear the blazing sun, until..."
# "You will bear the blazing sun, until the pale dawn breaks."
# Witness Spirithief Bartholos stealing the Coreflame
# Witness Khaslana's response
# Perform Oronyx's Miracle to take back the Coreflame
# Defeat Spirithief Bartholos to take back the Coreflame

