===Witness the truth of Amphoreus{{subst:void|<!--104050401-->}}===
{{Mission Description|type=trailblaze|location=Vortex of Genesis|Let me tell a tale of a swarm of nymphs that chase the scorching dawn. The Paean of Era Nova...<br />For their light slips through the gate while their shadow greets the throne, for they walked through the petals in the land of repose, yet fell finally at dawn's rise...<br />They cast themselves into the source of golden blood to awaken:<br />The Worldbearer, the Deliverer, the Roarer, the one with Ever-Burning Flame.<br />He will sacrifice all he loves, and his offering shall never end.}}
{{Dialogue Start}}

