::The 33,550,336th Eternal Recurrence
::'''The Hero Within:''' 33,550,337...
::'''The Hero Within:''' This is the cycle you're about to enter.
::'''Phainon:''' ...
::'''Phainon:''' Countless memories... are flooding in.
::'''Phainon:''' Countless versions of myself... have stood here, facing the same choice.
::'''The Hero Within:''' They all needed a moment, just like you do, to stop, to breathe, to process the weight of a million lifetimes' worth of sorrow, pain, and struggle.
::'''The Hero Within:''' And just like them, you will carry those memories and that fire... into the chaos of rebirth.
::'''Phainon:''' ...
::'''Phainon:''' I must go... and bear this burden.
::'''Phainon:''' I must say goodbye to you... and then fight the Destruction with Destruction.
::'''The Hero Within:''' Yes. That's always the decision you make.
::'''Phainon:''' {{Цвет|Ключевой|nobold=1|I will burn... and fade away. I will become the Flame Reaver of this life and keep my promise to Cyrene.}}
::'''Phainon:''' {{Цвет|Ключевой|nobold=1|I will kill gods and comrades alike and steal the Coreflames. And even if my mind turns to ash along with my body, I will keep my purpose in mind...}}
::'''Phainon:''' {{Цвет|Ключевой|nobold=1|I will stop Era Nova. I will find the next me... and make him carry on this futile endeavor of thirty million lifetimes.}}
::'''The Hero Within:''' ...Looks like you're ready.
::'''The Hero Within:''' Then I should be going, too.
::'''Phainon:''' Where... are you going?
::'''Phainon:''' You only exist in my heart. There's nowhere else for you to go.
::'''The Hero Within:''' Do you remember what she said? The dreams you had as children? The Deliverer in the prophecies? A real, living, breathing person...
::'''The Hero Within:''' You finally found {{MC|м=him.|ж=her.}}
::'''Phainon:''' (Trailblazer)...
::{{Диалог|Стрелка}} I... I'm being pulled into your memories.
:::'''Phainon:''' I see. You were there all along...
:::Is there anything I can do?
::{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Is there anything I can do?
::'''Phainon:''' I don't have an answer for that, my friend...
::'''Phainon:''' ...I'm sorry. I was supposed to send you home. This is my Flame-Chase Journey. You were never meant to be part of it...
::{{tx}}
:----
::'''The Hero Within:''' In millions of cycles, I've said goodbye to each and every one of you, yet nothing ever changes.
::'''The Hero Within:''' Each time we speak, our words grow fewer. Your fire burns hotter, and you're getting closer... to becoming pure rage, a vessel of hatred.
::'''Phainon:''' I... never had a choice.
::'''The Hero Within:''' I understand. If you are to keep the worst fate from unfolding, this is the only path.
::'''The Hero Within:''' But this time... things are different. Your persistence has shifted the tide. On the horizon, I see it, faint but undeniable, the shape of dawn, breaking through the eternal night.
::'''Phainon:''' ...Turns out, the fire that lights the way was never mine to begin with.
::'''The Hero Within:''' Do you remember? In that first timeline, you and Mydeimos stood before the Scales of Justice, locked in a "duel," each of you weighing what you held dearest, "what weighed more than the fate of the world."
::'''The Hero Within:''' And when hesitation took hold, the answer you sought from me...
::'''The Hero Within:''' ...What am I saying? {{Цвет|Ключевой|nobold=1|I am you}}. Even if you buried me deep and chose another path, that fact never changed.
::'''The Hero Within:''' Then let's try again. When you stood before the scales in hesitation, {{Цвет|Ключевой|nobold=1|the answer you found in your own heart...}}
::'''The Hero Within:''' Do you still remember it?
::'''Phainon:''' ...
::'''Phainon:''' {{Цвет|Ключевой|nobold=1|Remember the past, and become the hero of tomorrow.}}
::'''Phainon:''' {{Цвет|Ключевой|nobold=1|What weighs more than the fate of the world is the resolve to shoulder an immutable past, and carry it into the future.}}
::'''The Hero Within:''' Good. Then, (Trailblazer), my friend, my comrade...
::'''The Hero Within:''' You arrived in this strange world and were bound by its cruel fate up till this very moment.
::'''The Hero Within:''' In the face of danger, you never once backed down. Instead, you've saved world after world, without hesitation. That boarding pass on your chest... is now the mark of a hero.
::'''The Hero Within:''' If I choose to step through that door and embrace an end fitting of the Destruction, {{Цвет|Ключевой|nobold=1|let this sun forged from millions and millions of Coreflames burn me up along with the god of Destruction and THEIR minions...}}
::'''The Hero Within:''' Then the world we leave behind, this world, my home, where hope still lingers...
::'''The Hero Within:''' {{Цвет|Ключевой|nobold=1|Will you take on everything we've carried, return to the beginning one last time, stop the {{Rubi|{{Цвет|Ключевой|nobold=1|birth}}|{{Цвет|Ключевой|nobold=1|completion}}}} of Irontomb, save the world we love, and rewrite its doomed fate?}}
::{{Диалог|Стрелка}} I will.
::{{Диалог|Стрелка}} I will be the dawn of Amphoreus.
::{{Диалог|Стрелка}} I will... stop the completion of Irontomb.
::'''The Hero Within:''' So...
::'''Phainon:''' If (Trailblazer) takes on the weight of the whole world...
::'''Phainon:''' {{MC|м=He'll|ж=She'll}} be able to walk further down the path of Deliverance than a fire that only knows how to burn.
::'''Phainon:''' One will step into the future...
::'''Phainon:''' One will remain in the past.
::'''Phainon:''' If I can strike down the gods with Dawnmaker, perhaps fate's deadlock can be broken.
::'''Phainon:''' And if you can stop Irontomb from ever {{Rubi|being born|completion}}... then these thirty million cycles will have not been in vain.
::'''Phainon:''' It's time to put our teamwork to the test, partner.
::{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Go fight for the future, Phainon.
::{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Leave the world to me, Phainon.
::{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Let's both be the Deliverer, Phainon.
::'''Phainon:''' Cyrene. A page never seen before has just been turned.
::{{tx}}
